  "title": "Fire-Roasted Poblano Salsa",
  "description": "This poblano salsa involves roasting the poblano pepper, jalapeño, and onion over an open fire to bring a nice smoky flavor to this quick salsa.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
